- @title = 'Developer Evangelist · Nitrous'
- @html_class = 'dark'
- @body_id = 'jobs'


.page
  .page-hero
    .container
      = render partial: 'layouts/webnav', locals: { active: 'jobs' }
      .hero-copy
        h2
          | Developer Evangelist
        h3
          | San Francisco
          
  article.job-listing
    .container
    
      .content
        .job-intro
          h3 We're changing the way the world codes.
          p 
            | We are a results and data-driven organization. This allows us to avoid the bureaucracy of typical large companies. We value people who are doers instead of talkers, who obsess over the details, who listen to data yet know when to trust their gut, and who empathize with our users.
          p
            | At Nitrous, we're making programming more enjoyable and programmers and teams more productive. As a developer evangelist at Nitrous, you will interact with beginner, amateur and professional programmers to educate them on Nitrous's most powerful features, and listen to them to help us continually improve the platform.

        .job-description
          p
            | We are looking for developer evangelists with boundless energy who love traveling, meeting new people, and are obsessed with new technology and changing the way programmers work.

          h4 Responsibilities
          ul
            li Giving talks and demos of new Nitrous features at conferences
            li Writing Call for Papers and Abstracts to submit to developer conferences
            li Traveling to conferences and representing the company
            li Writing tutorials about how to use Nitrous with different technologies
            li Creating "how-to" videos and other introduction videos

          h4 Requirements
          ul
            li Excellent written and verbal communication skills
            li Experience with public speaking, specifically on technical topics
            li Experience demoing technical products in front of large audiences

          h4 To apply, please provide the following:
          ul
            li Github Profile with code you've written
            li Links to blog and/or videos of talks
            li Links to community profiles like Twitter, Hacker News, Stack Overflow, Reddit, etc...
            li Why you want to change development
            
      .sidebar
        h4 Perks
        ul
          li Competitive salary &amp; equity
          li Company-covered lunch
          li Health, Vision &amp; Dental Insurance
          li Choice of equipment
          li Flexible vacation
          li Fun company events
          li Referral bonus program
          li SF-Singapore exchange program
        
        a class="btn blue" href="mailto:jobs@nitrous.io?subject=Developer Evangelist @ Nitrous"
          | Apply for this position
        
        p.small
          | Nitrous does not accept agency resumes.
          br
          | Nitrous is an equal opportunity employer.



